XPOLYMORPHING YOURSELF AND YOUR ITEMS (and other masochistic pastimes):
X
XNOTE: The following only applies to nethack, and certain updated versions
Xof hack.
X
XThe user should be aware that he is able in some versions to cast
Xpolymorph on himself and on objects, as well as on monsters.
X
XTo polymorph yourself (and, in fact, to cast any spell on yourself), you
Xtype "." for the spell's direction. Polymorphing yourself results in the
Xcharacter becoming some type of monster. The character's hit points will be
Xreduced to conform with the monster type, and the character will gain all
Xabilities of the monster he is.
X
XBe forewarned, however, that any armor you are wearing when you polymorph
Xmay be destroyed, and that non-humanoid monsters can not wear armor or wield
Xweapons, in addition to there more limited hit points. Polymorphing is not
Xfor everyone.
X
XTo polymorph an object, simply drop the object, and polymorph in the
Xdirection of the object, as if it were a monster. Objects are polymorphed
Xinto random objects of the same type. For instance, a food ration can be
Xpolymorphed into a carrot, a tripe ration, or any other comestible. The
Xonly exception is that rocks are polymorphed into gems.
X
XThe uses for this become quite clear after some thought on the readers part.
XFor instance, useless items can be transformed into more powerful ones. In
Xparticular, polymorphing wands has its own special side effects.
X
